       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-SURF-TENSION.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-SURF-TENSION-PROOFS.
           05  WS-PRESSURE-JUMP-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CURVATURE-SMOOTH-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ENERGY-MINIMIZE-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CURVATURE-LATENCY-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SURF-TENSION-SEAL-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-SURF-TENSION-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-SURF-PROVEN          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-SURF-CODE          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-PRESSURE-AND-SMOOTH.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-MINIMIZE-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-SURF-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-PRESSURE-AND-SMOOTH.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PRESSURE-JUMP-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CURVATURE-SMOOTH-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-MINIMIZE-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ENERGY-MINIMIZE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CURVATURE-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-SURF-PROOFS.
           IF WS-PRESSURE-JUMP-OK = 1 AND
              WS-CURVATURE-SMOOTH-OK = 1 AND
              WS-ENERGY-MINIMIZE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-CURVATURE-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-SURF-TENSION-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-SURF-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-SURF-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-SURF-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-SURF-CODE.
